Z||000000||AusFiero||12-31-2001||10:48 AM||||And I don't mean tank tops.<BR>Well I have come to the conclusion they must because when I used to cruise in my Fiero with the tops off I would get waves and smiles and such from many women. Well Fieros are rare here and all.<BR>Well Saturday night I was out in my MR2 with the t-tops off and some music paying (well loudly I suppose) and this cute young blonde of about 20ish comes up to my passenger side and asks me to take her for a drive. Well being married and valueing my family jewels I said "no, I don't think my wife would like that too much" Her reply as she left was "OK. I'm over ya now" Quite witty on her part I thought. <BR>Now I am assuming its not me they want...lol but the cars. T-tops rule  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero5.gif">         <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
